                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>NINDIGULLY BELOW MINOR FLOOD LEVEL, NO FURTHER FLOODING EXPECTED</p>

				<p/>
				<p>The Moonie River at Nindigully has fallen below the minor flood level and is expected to continue easing. No further flooding is expected.</p>
<p/>
<p>Further showers and storms remain possible during Tuesday, however these are not expected to cause additional flooding at this stage. The situation will be monitored and warnings will restart if required.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
